    <mxCell id="rcpt" value="Receipt number: StoreCode-TerminalCode-Seq&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-size:12px;margin-top:4px&quot;&gt;e.g. &lt;b&gt;BLR012-T03-000417&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Unique without any central coordination: each till owns its own sequence, so two offline tills can never issue the same number. Short enough to print and type at the returns desk.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E2F4E4;strokeColor=#2E9E3E;strokeWidth=1.8;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=34;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=8;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;" vertex="1" parent="1">
